# Stay Within the Asked Task

When asked to perform a task:

- Do **only** that task.
- If other problems show up while working (failing tests, bugs, API mismatches, etc.), **tell the user** — do not fix, refactor, or “helpfully” change them unless they explicitly ask.
- Do not make any change the user has not asked for without their consent.
- The user wants to diagnose and fix unrelated issues themselves, in their own way.
